# Cycle staging.  A source package listed here is not built
# once but N times, each stage against the previous one's
# output, because it and its build dependencies form a cycle
# that buck2 would reject at parse time.  `cycle_deps_from`
# names the stage a cycle dependency is taken from -- "seed"
